00:05:30.640 --> 00:05:32.910 position:63%
NICK: Yeah. Well, yeah, the centre of it.

00:05:33.060 --> 00:05:36.230 position:63%
Yeah, yeah. It'd be 68 feet diameter.

00:05:36.520 --> 00:05:39.870 position:63%
Yeah. I'm not fluent in feet,
