00:05:39.940 --> 00:05:41.240 position:63%
NICK: In the UK you're not fluent in feet?

00:05:41.280 --> 00:05:41.580 position:63%
MATT: Well,

00:05:41.560 --> 00:05:42.450 position:63%
NICK: Isn't that where it started?

00:05:42.820 --> 00:05:43.320 position:63%
