00:05:43.360 --> 00:05:44.280 position:63%
[laughs]

00:05:44.320 --> 00:05:44.620 position:63%
NICK: Well, I've...

00:05:44.360 --> 00:05:46.780 position:63%
NICK: No, trust me
MATT: I started in Australia, so I'm,

00:05:46.820 --> 00:05:47.720 position:63%
NICK: Oh, I see, I see.

