- [laughing]

00:06:43.430 --> 00:06:44.340 position:63%
NICK: A little yeah?

00:06:44.490 --> 00:06:46.330 position:63%
- And...
- And there you go.

00:06:46.370 --> 00:06:47.550 position:63%
- Oh, yeah, yeah.
